      },
      "reviewBody": "I went here a few weeks ago and had the most lovely experience. Cathy was super helpful and kind, and had the best recommendations! 10/10 my absolute favorite dispensary I've ever gone to and will definitely be back. Thank you Cathy - you are truly the best!",
